* text=auto eol=lf
**/gradlew text eol=lf
**/gradlew.bat text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpeg binary
*.jpg binary
*.ogg binary
*.mp4 binary
*.wav binary
*.nbt binary
*.nwm binary
*.jar binary
# 源模型及校验产物按原字节保存，避免克隆后的换行转换破坏来源摘要。
*.bbmodel -text
assets/runtime/** -text
# 生产资源按原字节进入 JAR，避免配方或材质换行转换使独立构建摘要偏离正式包。
mod/src/main/resources/** -text whitespace=cr-at-eol
ports/**/src/**/resources/** -text whitespace=cr-at-eol
validation/*-gametest.txt -text
